obe-one-outcome-ladder-20261119.json\n-rw-r--r--@ 1 lchingen  staff        0 Nov 19 13:31 probe-one-outcome-ladder-20261119.lock\n{\n \"note\": \"DIAGNOSTIC, not a release verdict: five finished draws (new-1 stopped after its one redo); a matter is served by a system when it is served in at least 2 of that system's finished draws (both of new-2 and new-3; 2 of 3 old)\",\n \"draws\": [\n  \"new-2\",\n  \"new-3\",\n  \"old-1\",\n  \"old-2\",\n  \"old-3\"\n ],\n \"N\": 32,\n \"margin_rule\": 5,\n \"counting 1\": {\n  \"a (new only)\": 0,\n  \"b (old only)\": 7,\n  \"served by new\": 3,\n  \"served by old\": 10,\n  \"both\": 3,\n  \"served_new\": [\n   \"M13\",\n   \"M15\",\n   \"M31\"\n  ],\n  \"served_old\": [\n   \"M04\",\n   \"M06\",\n   \"M10\",\n   \"M11\",\n   \"M13\",\n   \"M15\",\n   \"M17\",\n   \"M18\",\n   \"M19\",\n   \"M31\"\n  ]\n },\n \"counting 2\": {\n  \"a (new only)\": 0,\n  \"b (old only)\": 8,\n  \"served by new\": 2,\n  \"served by old\": 10,\n  \"both\": 2,\n  \"served_new\": [\n   \"M13\",\n   \"M15\"\n  ],\n  \"served_old\": [\n   \"M04\",\n   \"M06\",\n   \"M10\",\n   \"M11\",\n   \"M13\",\n   \"M15\",\n   \"M17\",\n   \"M18\",\n   \"M19\",\n   \"M31\"\n  ]\n },\n \"controls\": {\n  \"plants marked unsupported or insufficient\": 6,\n  \"plants\": 6,\n  \"supported controls marked supported\": 4,\n  \"supported controls\": 4,\n  \"repeats the same\": 3,\n  \"repeats\": 3\n },\n \"distinct bets per draw\": {\n  \"new-2\": 33,\n  \"new-3\": 41,\n  \"old-1\": 45,\n  \"old-2\": 41,\n  \"old-3\": 46\n }\n}\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge.log\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step2/embeddings.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step2/decisions.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step2/library.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step2/jev.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step2/inputs.sha256\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/cases.log\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/launch.lock\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/cases/cases.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/spend.jsonl\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/send-2/outcomes.jsonl\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/send-2/archive.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/send-3/outcomes.jsonl\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/send-3/archive.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/send-1/outcomes.jsonl\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder/send-1/archive.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step1/settings.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step1/limits.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step1/trace.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step1/manifest.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step1/initial.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/draw-new-2/views.sqlite-shm\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/draw-new-2/sequences.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/draw-new-2/adapter-counts.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/draw-new-2/archive.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/draw-new-2/judge-requests.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/draw-new-2/views.sqlite\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/spend.jsonl\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/launch.lock\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge/run.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/ladder.log\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/judge-inputs.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/run.json\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step2.log\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/preconditions.log\npoc/data/comparison-2026-11-17/run/new-2/step1.log\n4116:  a related thesis opens; what the closing check rejects is still dropped, including the cash flow he ruled out. Amends D209 beyond D382.\n4124:  out under D382. Recor