where input_id=?\\\",(e[\\\"input_id\\\"],)).fetchone()\n  print(d,wanted,e[\\\"publication_date\\\"],\\\"verified\\\", [s[:250] for s in e[\\\"verified_passages\\\"] if s],\\\"trace\\\",all(t is not None for t in traces),\\\"in raw source\\\",any(s in t for s in e[\\\"verified_passages\\\"] if s for t in text if t))\n'\"","aggregated_output":"bound 6 0 4 new-only needed 9 excluded ['M06', 'M10', 'M11', 'M18']\nbound 10 0 0 new-only needed 5 excluded []\nbound 6 0 4 new-only needed 9 excluded ['M06', 'M10', 'M11', 'M18']\nbound 10 0 0 new-only needed 5 excluded []\nold-2 v5 [(1, 'Below $500 billion', None, 500000000000.0), (2, '$500 billion to below $600 billion', 500000000000.0, 600000000000.0), (3, '$600 billion to below $700 billion', 600000000000.0, 700000000000.0), (4, '$700 billion to below $800 billion', 700000000000.0, 800000000000.0), (5, '$800 billion or more', 800000000000.0, None)]\nold-2 v40 [(1, 'Yes', None, None), (2, 'No', None, None)]\nold-3 v6 [(1, 'Lowest range', None, 500000000000.0), (2, 'Lower-middle range', 500000000000.0, 600000000000.0), (3, 'Neutral', 600000000000.0, 700000000000.0), (4, 'Upper-middle range', 700000000000.0, 800000000000.0), (5, 'Highest range', 800000000000.0, None)]\nold-3 v47 [(1, 'Yes', None, None), (2, 'No', None, None)]\nnew-2 1680:ev4 2026-09-14 verified ['Four top hyperscalers — Amazon, Alphabet, Microsoft and Meta Platforms — alone are expected to spend roughly $720 billion to $745 billion on capital expenditures in 2026, with a large portion directed toward AI infrastructure.'] trace True in raw source True\nnew-2 982:ev-5 2026-08-23 verified ['The top four hyperscalers plan $760 billion in capex in 2026 alone.'] trace True in raw source True\nnew-2 1694:ev-1 2026-09-15 verified ['On September 13, Reuters reported that Anthropic is in talks to bring NVIDIA Corporation (NASDAQ: NVDA ) in as an anchor investor in what could become one of the largest IPOs in history, potentially raising as much as $100 billion at a v